      "text": "many are already lost from knowledge of those at Jerusalem, 1 Ne. 22:4. the Lord will speak to Jews, Nephites, other tribes, and they shall write, 2 Ne. 29:12. Jews, Nephites, and lost tribes shall have each others’ writings, 2 Ne. 29:13. the Father has not commanded Christ to tell Jews about other tribes whom the Father led away, 3 Ne. 15:15. the Father separated other tribes from Jews because of iniquity, 3 Ne. 15:20. Christ will show himself to lost tribes, 3 Ne. 17:4. gospel to be preached to lost tribes, 3 Ne. 21:26. Three Nephites shall minister unto all scattered tribes, 3 Ne. 28:29. they who were scattered and gathered from north countries are partakers of fulfilling of covenant, Ether 13:11.",
